      o: ['“Avoid drinking excessive alcohol of any type.”', '“If you become obese, follow a weight-loss program that works rapidly.”', '“Avoid ever having an ERCP.”', '“Avoid multiple pregnancies because you could get gallstones.”'], a: [0],
      r: ['Correct. Alcohol causes about 30% of acute pancreatitis.', 'Incorrect. Rapid weight loss causes gallstones — the other main cause; lose weight slowly.', 'Incorrect. ERCP carries risk, but is sometimes needed; clients are informed before consent.', 'Incorrect. Not a reasonable prevention teaching.'],
      ask: 'Which modifiable cause can the client control?', cues: ['Gallstones and alcohol are the two main causes'],
